{"id": 1013026, "slug": "we-escaped-a-twisted-game", "name": "We Escaped a Twisted Game", "name_original": "We Escaped a Twisted Game", "description": "<p>The gates have opened. The rules are simple: escape… or stay forever.</p><br/><br/><p>◈   ◈</p><br/><p>Exploring a haunted manor quickly turns into a twisted game of survival. Split apart by walls but connected by voice, you’ll have to rely on each other if you want to see the outside again.</p><br/><br/><p>◈</p><p>◈</p><br/><p>You’ll never see the full picture alone. Half the clues are yours, the rest belong to your partner — share what you see and guide each other through the unknown… and be careful what else might be listening. Built-in 3D voice chat keeps you connected.</p><br/><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> This escape can only be played in co-op. Each player needs their own device and game copy.</p><br/><p>◈</p><p>◈</p><br/><p>And it’s not your partner keeping you company.</p><br/><br/><p>◈</p><p>◈</p><br/><p>Private lobbies for friends, public lobbies for strangers — either way, you’ll be inside the manor in moments. Getting out? That’s the hard part.</p><h3>Features</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Online co-op:</strong> 2 players only</p></li><li><p><strong>Two perspectives:</strong> unique roles</p></li><li><p><strong>Built-in 3D voice chat</strong> with character voice lines</p></li><li><p><strong>Puzzle mix:</strong> guiding, frantic, clever</p></li><li><p><strong>15 handcrafted challenges</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li></ul><br/><p>◈   ◈</p><br/><p><strong>Wishlist</strong> now and prepare to enter the twisted game.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-10-24", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-07-08T21:22:46", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/74e/74ee4acf0fc9adbdcedd7423422e5817.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/dff/dff3975e9efde51492f092b618b878c2.jpg", "website": "https: