 "Квест-комната", "slug": "kvest-komnata", "language": "eng", "games_count": 149, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/789/7892e4c24e13b57d48fec9233273bdac.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 91572, "name": "Deluded Games", "slug": "deluded-games", "games_count": 1, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/74e/74ee4acf0fc9adbdcedd7423422e5817.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "The gates have opened. The rules are simple: escape… or stay forever.\n◈   ◈\nExploring a haunted manor quickly turns into a twisted game of survival. Split apart by walls but connected by voice, you’ll have to rely on each other if you want to see the outside again.\n◈◈\nYou’ll never see the full picture alone. Half the clues are yours, the rest belong to your partner — share what you see and guide each other through the unknown… and be careful what else might be listening. Built-in 3D voice chat keeps you connected.\nPLEASE NOTE: This escape can only be played in co-op. Each player needs their own device and game copy.\n◈◈\nAnd it’s not your partner keeping you company.\n◈◈\nPrivate lobbies for friends, public lobbies for strangers — either way, you’ll be inside the manor in moments. Getting out? That’s the hard part.FeaturesOnline co-op: 2 players onlyTwo perspectives: unique rolesBuilt-in 3D voice chat with character voice linesPuzzle mix: guiding, frantic, clever15 handcrafted challengesMultiple endings\n◈   ◈\nWishlist now and prepare to enter the twisted game."}